# NOT READ BY DOCKER. BuildKit reads only the .dockerignore at the build
# CONTEXT root, and the API image is built with the repo root as its context
# (fly.toml → apps/api/Dockerfile). This file has had no effect since it was
# written in May 2026; the rules that matter are in /.dockerignore. Kept only
# so that deleting it is a deliberate act rather than a surprise — add
# exclusions to the root file.
node_modules
.env
.env.local
*.log
.git
.next
dist
